      <span class="card__tag">Observability</span>
      <h3>Unified telemetry</h3>
      <p>Consolidated logs, metrics, and traces into a single pane with cost-aware retention.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <span class="card__tag">Security</span>
